OL,3,GNEWSANeglect case childminder was
OL,4,A'master manipulator', say parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents whose children were cared for
OL,7,Fby a childminder who has admitted
OL,8,Fneglect charges have described her as a
OL,9,F"master manipulator".
OL,11,FAmanda Mathewson had been looking after
OL,12,Fmany more children than she was allowed
OL,13,Fto - and at one stage left 27
OL,14,Fyoungsters alone and unsupervised at
OL,15,Fher home in Dunfermline.
OL,17,FFamilies told BBC Scotland that the
OL,18,F55-year-old had been "loved and
OL,19,Ftrusted" in the community before her
OL,20,Fcrimes came to light.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
